# 7. SSID VS BSSID

### SSID

The network name users see.

Example:

```text
NAVLAN-WIFI
```

### BSSID

Typically identifies the AP/radio using a MAC address.

Example:

```text
AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF
```

Important:

> Multiple APs can use the same SSID.

Therefore:

> **SSID alone is not enough to identify an authorized AP.**

