# 36. WIRELESS DETECTION WORKFLOW

Remember:

> **D-B-M-A-I-R**

### D — Discover

Identify wireless devices.

### B — Baseline

Understand normal behavior.

### M — Monitor

Continuously observe.

### A — Analyze

Look for anomalies.

### I — Investigate

Validate suspicious events.

### R — Respond

Contain/remediate according to policy.

