# 54. RADIUS CORRELATION

Enterprise Wi-Fi may use:

```text
Client
   ↓
AP
   ↓
RADIUS
   ↓
Authentication
```

A WIDS alert can be correlated with authentication records.

Example:

```text
Unknown AP
+
Unexpected authentication behavior
+
RADIUS anomalies
```

