---

# 55. DHCP CORRELATION

If an unknown wireless client obtains an IP address:

```text
Wireless Client
      ↓
Rogue/unknown AP
      ↓
DHCP
      ↓
IP address
```

DHCP logs may help identify:

- Assigned IP
- MAC address
- Timestamp

