An organization normally uses WPA2/WPA3 Enterprise, but an AP using the same SSID appears as an open network.

What is this?

A. A potentially serious configuration/security anomaly  
B. Normal TCP behavior  
C. DNS resolution  
D. DHCP renewal

**Answer: A**

